flowchart TD
    Start[Inbound request or message] --> Source{Trusted source?}
    Source -- No --> Deny[Reject: source or producer denied]
    Source -- Yes --> Scope{Declared scope}
    Scope -- Public --> Public[No tenant context]
    Scope -- Platform --> Admin{Authorized platform actor?}
    Admin -- No --> Deny
    Admin -- Yes --> Platform[Platform scope]
    Scope -- Tenant --> Explicit{Explicit tenant present?}
    Explicit -- Malformed or duplicate --> DenyTenant[Reject: tenant invalid]
    Explicit -- Yes --> Member{Actor may access tenant?}
    Explicit -- No --> Primary{Exactly one trusted primary tenant?}
    Primary -- No --> DenyTenant
    Primary -- Yes --> Tenant[Tenant scope]
    Member -- No --> DenyTenant
    Member -- Yes --> Tenant
